it's changed quite a lot now,

00:54:13.880 --> 00:54:16.700
but South Africans used to turn
off the data on their phone

00:54:16.700 --> 00:54:20.750
because they were afraid of being
charged on their mobile plan because

00:54:22.010 --> 00:54:24.150
internet was very expensive,

00:54:26.570 --> 00:54:28.650
