though I'm, by South African

00:54:53.100 --> 00:54:55.560
standards, very,
very well off. But

00:54:56.490 --> 00:54:58.920
it wasn't worth it
from that perspective.

00:54:59.550 --> 00:55:04.800
And so these demonstrations,
which were video recorded were

00:55:04.800 --> 00:55:08.650
just like gold dust to me.
They were like something which I,

00:55:08.650 --> 00:55:09.570
as somebody who lived

00:55:11.430 --> 00:55:12.870
thousands of kilometers away,

00:55:13.500 --> 00:55:17.550
could experience this world and
got insight into this world and

00:55:17.550 --> 00:55:20.535
live demonstrations. And I'm
very, very grateful for that.

00:55:21.090 --> 00:55:22.650
It changed my life. And

00:55:25.980 --> 00:55:28.110
that's a story that I'll tell,

00:55:28.110 --> 00:55:32.310
having to download those
YouTube videos. And of course,

00:55:32.310 --> 00:55:33.660
